                <ITEXT FONT="Merriweather Regular" FONTSIZE="13" FCOLOR="Text-Base-Dark" SCALEV="100" CH="De­vel­op­ment and im­ple­men­ta­tion of PNG im­age de­coder and en­coder ac­cord­ing to the spec­i­fi­ca­tions (PNG Stan­dard v1.2)."/>
